  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ONTARIO QUEBEC ATLANTIC PROTECTING WETL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will enable securement of approximately 2,250 new acres, and the stewardship of approximately 1,400 acres, with enhancement to occur on 2 acres and management of 67,603 habitat acres on target priority wetlands and associated uplands in the provinces of Ontario, Quebec, New Brunswick, Nova Scotia, Prince Edward Island and Newfoundland and Labrador.</narrative>
  </description>
